<title>USA: ST PAUL HOGS $0.50 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST PAUL HOGS $0.50 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50</p>
<p>lower. Top $56.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   56.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   56.00-56.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows: uneven, weights under 450 lbs steady to 1.00 lower; over</p>
<p>450 lbs steady to 0.50 higher. Top 49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-450 lbs   45.50-46.00</p>
<p>	     450-500 lbs   46.50-47.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   47.00-47.50</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   48.50-49.50</p>
</text>
